<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPAIN CALL UP STRIKER URZAIZ.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPAIN CALL UP STRIKER URZAIZ.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athletic Bilbao striker Ismael Urzaiz has replaced injured Barcelona defender Sergi Barjuan in Spain's World Cup squad for Sunday's qualifier against the Czech Republic.</p>
<p>Urzaiz won his first cap against the Czechs in September but has not represented his country since.</p>
<p>Sergi strained his leg during club training.</p>
